print("\n=== (D) the coupled resolution vs a threshold-only recursion on the corank-≥2 binder (3,3,4) ===")
# (3,3,4) binding t=(1,0): layer-1 corank block is (M1-t1)x(M2-t1)=(2)x(3)? -> the Δ-block. The coupled
